---
Checks:
  - -*,
  - boost-*,
  - bugprone-*,
  - clang-analyzer-*,
  - misc-*,
  - performance-*,
  - portability-*,
  - readability-*,
  - -readability-magic-numbers,
  - modernize-avoid-c-arrays,
  - modernize-use-using,
  - clang-diagnostic-*,
CheckOptions:
  - key: readability-implicit-bool-conversion.AllowIntegerConditions
    value: 1
  - key: readability-implicit-bool-conversion.AllowPointerConditions
    value: 1
...
